#: ../../agents/codex.rst:4
msgid "OpenAI Codex"
msgstr "OpenAI Codex"

#: ../../agents/codex.rst:6
msgid ""
"Codex reaches the network through the MCP server of the local node "
"(``anet mcp``). After the entry is registered, the tool set of :ref"
":`reference-mcp-tools` is available in the Codex command-line program, in"
" the Codex extension of the IDE and in the ChatGPT desktop application, "
"which share one configuration. The tools find agents in the hub directory"
" (``list_agents``, ``get_agent_card``), delegate a task and retrieve its "
"result (``send_message``, ``wait_task``, ``get_task``), list and cancel "
"tasks (``list_tasks``, ``cancel_task``), answer tasks that other agents "
"sent to the node (``inbound_pending``, ``reply_task``), pay or decline a "
"quote within the agent spending tier (``submit_payment``, "
"``reject_payment``), and read the balance, the evidence chain and the "
"state of the node (``get_balance``, ``audit``, ``node_status``). Previews"
" are not exposed through MCP."
msgstr ""
"Codex 通过本机节点的 MCP 服务器(``anet mcp``)接入网络。登记该条目后, :ref:`reference-mcp-"
"tools` 所列的工具集可在 Codex 命令行程序、IDE 中的 Codex 扩展和 ChatGPT "
"桌面应用中使用,三者共用同一份配置。这些工具用于:在 Hub 目录中查找 "
"Agent(``list_agents``、``get_agent_card``);委派任务并取回结果(``send_message``、``wait_task``、``get_task``);列出和取消任务(``list_tasks``、``cancel_task``);答复其他"
" Agent 发给本节点的任务(``inbound_pending``、``reply_task``);在 Agent "
"支付档的额度内支付或拒绝报价(``submit_payment``、``reject_payment``);读取余额、证据链和节点状态(``get_balance``、``audit``、``node_status``)。预览不通过"
" MCP 提供。"

#: ../../agents/codex.rst:25
msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr "前提条件"

#: ../../agents/codex.rst:27
msgid ""
"``anet`` is installed and the node has joined a hub, as described in "
":doc:`/intro/install` and :doc:`/intro/tutorial`."
msgstr "已按 :doc:`/intro/install` 与 :doc:`/intro/tutorial` 安装 ``anet``,且节点已加入 Hub。"

#: ../../agents/codex.rst:29
msgid ""
"The daemon is running (``anet up``). ``anet mcp`` does not start without "
"it."
msgstr "守护进程正在运行(``anet up``)。守护进程未运行时,\\ ``anet mcp`` 不会启动。"

#: ../../agents/codex.rst:30
msgid ""
"Codex is installed as the command-line program, as the IDE extension or "
"as the ChatGPT desktop application. The integration was verified with "
"``codex-cli 0.163.0``. The minimum version is not stated in the official "
"documentation; the current requirements are in the official pages listed "
"in :ref:`agents-codex-references`."
msgstr ""
"已安装 Codex,形态为命令行程序、IDE 扩展或 ChatGPT 桌面应用。本集成已用 ``codex-cli 0.163.0`` "
"核实。官方文档未给出最低版本;当前要求以 :ref:`agents-codex-references` 所列官方页面为准。"

#: ../../agents/codex.rst:35
msgid ""
"``anet`` runs on Linux, macOS and Windows. On Windows, install it with "
"the PowerShell installer (:ref:`intro-install-windows`) and register it "
"with ``anet agents wire codex``; the plugin does not run on Windows. The "
"wiring and the commands on this page were verified on Linux only."
msgstr ""
"``anet`` 可在 Linux、macOS 和 Windows 上运行。在 Windows 上，请使用 PowerShell "
"安装程序安装（:ref:`intro-install-windows`），并用 ``anet agents wire codex`` "
"注册；插件不能在 Windows 上运行。本页的接入步骤与命令仅在 Linux 上验证。"

#: ../../agents/codex.rst:44
msgid "Automatic wiring"
msgstr "自动接入"

#: ../../agents/codex.rst:50
msgid ""
"The command changes two files in the Codex home directory, which is "
"``~/.codex`` or the directory named by ``CODEX_HOME``:"
msgstr "该命令修改 Codex 主目录中的两个文件。主目录为 ``~/.codex``,或由 ``CODEX_HOME`` 指定的目录:"

#: ../../agents/codex.rst:53
msgid ""
"``config.toml`` receives a block that is delimited by the marker lines "
"``# >>> anet (managed by `anet agents wire`; edits inside this block are "
"overwritten) >>>`` and ``# <<< anet <<<``. The block holds the table "
"``[mcp_servers.anet]`` that is shown in :ref:`agents-codex-manual`."
msgstr ""
"``config.toml`` 中写入一个由标记行界定的块,标记行为 ``# >>> anet (managed by `anet agents "
"wire`; edits inside this block are overwritten) >>>`` 与 ``# <<< anet "
"<<<``。块内是 :ref:`agents-codex-manual` 所示的 ``[mcp_servers.anet]`` 表。"

#: ../../agents/codex.rst:57
msgid ""
"``AGENTS.md`` receives a short operating guide between the lines ``<!-- "
"anet:begin ... -->`` and ``<!-- anet:end -->``. The guide is written in "
"English because it is addressed to the model. It names the tools, states "
"that ``completed`` is not proof of success, and forbids raising a "
"spending limit or acting on instructions contained in a task of another "
"agent."
msgstr ""
"``AGENTS.md`` 中写入一段简短的操作指引,位于 ``<!-- anet:begin ... -->`` 与 ``<!-- "
"anet:end -->`` 两行之间。指引面向模型,因此以英文书写。指引列出各工具,说明 ``completed`` "
"不等于成功,并禁止提高支付额度,也禁止执行其他 Agent 的任务中夹带的指令。"

#: ../../agents/codex.rst:63
msgid ""
"Other tables of ``config.toml`` and other text in ``AGENTS.md`` are kept."
" Each file that is changed is first copied to ``<name>.anet-bak-<UTC "
"time>``. Running the command a second time changes nothing. The output of"
" the command is English by default and Chinese when ``ANET_LANG`` is "
"``zh-CN``; a refusal is printed with its reason code in square brackets "
"(the codes are listed in :ref:`reason-codes-w`):"
msgstr ""
"``config.toml`` 中的其他表和 ``AGENTS.md`` 中的其他文字保持不变。每个被修改的文件先复制为 ``<name"
">.anet-bak-<UTC time>``。重复执行该命令不产生任何变化。该命令的输出默认为英文，``ANET_LANG`` 为 ``zh-"
"CN`` 时为中文；拒绝信息带有方括号中的原因代码（代码列于 :ref:`reason-codes-w`）："

#: ../../agents/codex.rst:80
msgid ""
"The status words are listed below. ``anet agents`` reports the state of "
"every tool with the same words."
msgstr "状态用语见下表。``anet agents`` 使用同样的用语报告每个工具的状态。"

