msgstr "ChatGPT 桌面应用:保存文件后点击 **Restart** 按钮。"

#: ../../agents/codex.rst:121
msgid "IDE extension: **Restart extension**."
msgstr "IDE 扩展:**Restart extension**。"

#: ../../agents/codex.rst:122
msgid ""
"Command-line program: a new session. The official documentation does not "
"state whether a running session reads a changed file."
msgstr "命令行程序:新开会话。官方文档未说明正在运行的会话是否会读取已修改的文件。"

#: ../../agents/codex.rst:125
msgid ""
"When ``AGENTS.override.md`` exists in the Codex home directory, Codex "
"reads it in place of ``AGENTS.md``, and the guide written by ``wire`` has"
" no effect. The command then prints a note after the status word. It "
"never edits the override file; the guide is merged into that file by the "
"operator, or the file is moved away."
msgstr ""
"Codex 主目录中存在 ``AGENTS.override.md`` 时,Codex 读取该文件而不是 ``AGENTS.md``,\\ "
"``wire`` "
"写入的指引因此不起作用。此时命令在状态用语之后输出一条注意事项。命令从不编辑覆盖文件;由运维人员将指引并入该文件,或将该文件移走。"

#: ../../agents/codex.rst:135
msgid "Manual wiring"
msgstr "手动接入"

#: ../../agents/codex.rst:137
msgid ""
"Codex reads ``~/.codex/config.toml``. ``CODEX_HOME`` relocates the "
"directory. A file ``.codex/config.toml`` in a project is read only when "
"the project is trusted, and its values take precedence over those of the "
"user file. The order in the official documentation is: command-line "
"options, project files, profile, user file, system file "
"``/etc/codex/config.toml``. ``wire`` inspects the user file only; a "
"project file that defines ``mcp_servers.anet`` is not detected. In the "
"IDE extension the file is opened with the gear icon, then **Codex "
"Settings**, then **Open config.toml**."
msgstr ""
"Codex 读取 ``~/.codex/config.toml``,\\ ``CODEX_HOME`` 可改变该目录。项目中的 "
"``.codex/config.toml`` "
"仅在该项目被信任时读取,其取值优先于用户文件。官方文档给出的优先级为:命令行选项、项目文件、配置档(profile)、用户文件、系统文件 "
"``/etc/codex/config.toml``。``wire`` 只检查用户文件;项目文件中若定义了 "
"``mcp_servers.anet``,不会被检测到。在 IDE 扩展中,依次点击齿轮图标、**Codex Settings**、**Open "
"config.toml** 打开该文件。"

#: ../../agents/codex.rst:146
msgid ""
"Add the following table. The paths are replaced by the actual absolute "
"path of the ``anet`` binary and the data directory of the identity."
msgstr "添加下列表。路径替换为 ``anet`` 可执行文件的实际绝对路径和该身份的数据目录。"

#: ../../agents/codex.rst:158
msgid ""
"The absolute path and ``ANET_DATA_DIR`` are required because an MCP "
"client does not load the shell profile. The defaults of Codex are 10 "
"seconds for the start and 60 seconds for a tool call. A call that waits "
"for an agent on another machine can last minutes, so the values above are"
" kept. Codex can also register the entry itself; that command sets no "
"timeouts, which are then added to the file:"
msgstr ""
"必须使用绝对路径并设置 ``ANET_DATA_DIR``,因为 MCP 客户端不加载 shell 配置文件。Codex 的默认值为:启动 10 "
"秒,单次工具调用 60 秒。等待另一台机器上的 Agent 的调用可能持续数分钟,因此保留上述取值。Codex "
"也可以自行登记该条目;该命令不设置超时,需随后在文件中补充:"

#: ../../agents/codex.rst:169
msgid ""
"A machine can hold several identities. ``--id`` selects the identity "
"whose data directory is written to the entry. A tool has one ``anet`` "
"entry, and a later ``wire`` for another identity replaces the earlier "
"one."
msgstr ""
"一台机器可持有多个身份。``--id`` 选定其数据目录写入条目的身份。每个工具只有一个 ``anet`` 条目,之后为另一个身份执行 "
"``wire`` 会替换先前的条目。"

#: ../../agents/codex.rst:177
msgid ""
"Where the home directory of Codex is relocated, ``CODEX_HOME`` must have "
"the same value in the shell that runs ``wire`` and in the process that "
"starts Codex. The official documentation gives no configuration path for "
"Windows. Reports in the Codex issue tracker (`#13549 "
"<https://github.com/openai/codex/issues/13549>`_, `#22759 "
"<https://github.com/openai/codex/issues/22759>`_, `#15993 "
"<https://github.com/openai/codex/issues/15993>`_) describe a different "
"configuration home for the Windows application and for WSL. The path that"
" the extension opens is authoritative."
msgstr ""
"如果 Codex 的主目录被改动,运行 ``wire`` 的 shell 与启动 Codex 的进程中的 ``CODEX_HOME`` "
"必须取值相同。官方文档未给出 Windows 上的配置路径。Codex 问题跟踪中的报告(`#13549 "
"<https://github.com/openai/codex/issues/13549>`_、`#22759 "
"<https://github.com/openai/codex/issues/22759>`_、`#15993 "
"<https://github.com/openai/codex/issues/15993>`_)称 Windows 应用与 WSL "
"使用不同的配置主目录。以扩展所打开的路径为准。"

#: ../../agents/codex.rst:191
msgid "Plugin"
msgstr "插件"

#: ../../agents/codex.rst:193
msgid ""
"The ``anet`` plugin is an alternative to :ref:`agents-codex-wire`. It "
"registers the same MCP server (``anet mcp``) and adds three skills of "
"Codex: the operating guide, the setup procedure and the status check. "
"Installing it does not change ``config.toml`` or ``AGENTS.md``. The "
"plugin and ``anet agents wire codex`` are alternatives; use one of them, "
"not both (see :ref:`agents-codex-plugin-conflict`)."
msgstr ""
"``anet`` 插件可替代 :ref:`agents-codex-wire`\\ 。它注册同一个 MCP 服务器（``anet "
"mcp``），并增加三项 Codex 技能：运行指南、设置流程和状态检查。安装插件不会修改 ``config.toml`` 或 "
"``AGENTS.md``\\ 。插件与 ``anet agents wire codex`` 互为替代，二者择一使用，不应同时使用（参见 "
":ref:`agents-codex-plugin-conflict`\\ ）。"

#: ../../agents/codex.rst:200
msgid ""
"The plugin is distributed from the marketplace file in the ANet "
"repository. Its source is ``deploy/plugins/`` in that repository; the "
"installed copy has the version of ``plugin.json``."
msgstr ""
"该插件通过 ANet 仓库中的市场文件分发。其源码是该仓库中的 ``deploy/plugins/``；安装的副本带有 "
"``plugin.json`` 中的版本号。"

#: ../../agents/codex.rst:208
msgid "Component"
msgstr "组件"

#: ../../agents/codex.rst:209
msgid "Name"
msgstr "名称"

#: ../../agents/codex.rst:210
msgid "Purpose"
msgstr "用途"

#: ../../agents/codex.rst:211
msgid "MCP server"
msgstr "MCP 服务器"

#: ../../agents/codex.rst:212
msgid "``anet``"
msgstr "``anet``"

#: ../../agents/codex.rst:213
msgid ""
"Runs ``anet mcp`` through the script ``bin/anet-mcp.sh``, which is "
"started with ``sh`` and has the installed plugin as working directory."
msgstr "通过脚本 ``bin/anet-mcp.sh`` 运行 ``anet mcp``\\ ；该脚本由 ``sh`` 启动，工作目录为已安装的插件目录。"

#: ../../agents/codex.rst:215 ../../agents/codex.rst:218
#: ../../agents/codex.rst:223
msgid "Skill"
msgstr "技能"

#: ../../agents/codex.rst:216
msgid "``anet:anet``"
msgstr "``anet:anet``"

#: ../../agents/codex.rst:217
msgid "The operating guide that ``anet agents wire`` writes to ``AGENTS.md``."
msgstr "运行指南，与 ``anet agents wire`` 写入 ``AGENTS.md`` 的内容一致。"

#: ../../agents/codex.rst:219
msgid "``anet:anet-setup``"
msgstr "``anet:anet-setup``"

#: ../../agents/codex.rst:220
msgid ""
"Checks, installs or updates ``anet``, starts the node, joins a hub and "
"runs ``anet doctor``. Installation and update run only after the user "
"agrees."
msgstr "检查、安装或更新 ``anet``\\ ，启动节点，加入 hub，并运行 ``anet doctor``\\ 。安装与更新仅在用户同意后执行。"

#: ../../agents/codex.rst:224
msgid "``anet:anet-status``"
msgstr "``anet:anet-status``"

#: ../../agents/codex.rst:225
msgid ""
"Reports the node, its hub, the balance and the spending limits. Codex has"
" no slash commands, so the status check is a skill that is started with "
"``$anet:anet-status``."
msgstr ""
"报告节点、所在 hub、余额和支出限额。Codex 没有斜杠命令，因此状态检查以技能形式提供，使用 ``$anet:anet-status`` "
"启动。"

#: ../../agents/codex.rst:229
msgid ""
"Every ``anet`` command of the plugin runs through the script ``bin/anet-"
"run.sh``, so that the MCP server and the skills use the same executable "
"and the same identity."
msgstr ""
"插件的每条 ``anet`` 命令都经由脚本 ``bin/anet-run.sh`` 执行，使 MCP "
"服务器与各项技能使用同一可执行文件和同一身份。"

#: ../../agents/codex.rst:235
msgid "Installing the plugin"
msgstr "安装插件"

#: ../../agents/codex.rst:243
msgid ""
"The marketplace file is ``.agents/plugins/marketplace.json`` at the root "
"of the repository. It names the marketplace ``agentnetwork`` and points "
"to the directory ``deploy/plugins/dist/codex``. Codex 0.163.0 was used; "
"the minimum version is not stated in the official documentation. The "
"plugin was run on Linux. Its launchers are POSIX shell scripts and do not"
" run on Windows; on Windows, use ``anet agents wire codex``."
msgstr ""
"市场文件为仓库根目录下的 ``.agents/plugins/marketplace.json``\\ 。它将市场命名为 "
"``agentnetwork``\\ ，并指向目录 ``deploy/plugins/dist/codex``\\ 。测试使用 Codex "
"0.163.0；官方文档未说明最低版本。插件在 Linux 上运行过。其启动器是 POSIX shell 脚本，不能在 Windows 上运行；在"
" Windows 上，请使用 ``anet agents wire codex``\\ 。"

#: ../../agents/codex.rst:250
msgid ""
"``codex plugin list`` shows ``anet@agentnetwork`` as installed and "
"enabled. ``codex mcp list`` shows the server ``anet`` with the command "
"``sh ./bin/anet-mcp.sh``. A new session starts the server. The skills are"
" ``anet:anet``, ``anet:anet-setup`` and ``anet:anet-status``."
msgstr ""
"``codex plugin list`` 将 ``anet@agentnetwork`` 显示为已安装且已启用。``codex mcp "
"list`` 显示服务器 ``anet``\\ ，命令为 ``sh ./bin/anet-mcp.sh``\\ 。新会话会启动该服务器。技能为 "
"``anet:anet``\\ 、\\ ``anet:anet-setup`` 和 ``anet:anet-status``\\ 。"

#: ../../agents/codex.rst:257
msgid "Setting up the node"
msgstr "设置节点"

#: ../../agents/codex.rst:259
msgid ""
"The plugin does not require a prepared node. When ``anet`` is not "
"installed, the following prompt starts the setup procedure:"
msgstr "插件不要求事先准备好节点。尚未安装 ``anet`` 时，下列提示将启动设置流程："

#: ../../agents/codex.rst:266
msgid ""
"The procedure resolves the executable and reports that it is not found. "
"After the user agrees, it runs the official installer from "
"``agentnetwork.org.cn`` through a private temporary directory and removes"
" the directory afterwards. The installer verifies the signature and the "
"checksum of the release. The procedure then runs ``anet up``, joins the "
"hub with ``anet hub-register <hub URL> --name <name>`` and runs ``anet "
"doctor``. It reports the executable, the hub and every check that is not "
"``ok``. The commands that only the operator may run, for example changes "
"of the peer lists or of the spending limits, are not run by the "
"procedure."
msgstr ""
"该流程先解析可执行文件，并报告未找到。经用户同意后，它通过私有临时目录运行来自 ``agentnetwork.org.cn`` "
"的官方安装程序，并在结束后删除该目录。安装程序会校验发行版的签名和校验和。随后该流程运行 ``anet up``\\ ，使用 ``anet "
"hub-register <hub URL> --name <name>`` 加入 hub，并运行 ``anet doctor``\\ "
"。它报告可执行文件、hub，以及每一项结果不是 ``ok`` 的检查。仅限操作员运行的命令，例如修改对等方名单或支出限额，不由该流程执行。"

#: ../../agents/codex.rst:276
msgid ""
"When the setting ``ANET_PLUGIN_BIN`` names a file that is not executable,"
" the procedure stops before any installation and reports the invalid "
"setting."
msgstr "当设置项 ``ANET_PLUGIN_BIN`` 指向的文件不可执行时，该流程在任何安装之前停止，并报告设置无效。"

#: ../../agents/codex.rst:281
msgid "Verifying the plugin"
msgstr "验证插件"

#: ../../agents/codex.rst:283
msgid "In a new session, the following prompt starts the status check:"
msgstr "在新会话中，下列提示将启动状态检查："

#: ../../agents/codex.rst:289
msgid ""
"The expected result is a report of the identity, the AID, the node name, "
"the hub, the balance and the spending limits. It is obtained through the "
"MCP tools ``node_status`` and ``get_balance``. Warnings that ``anet "
"doctor`` reports, for example ``identity.recovery``, are repeated in the "
"report."
msgstr ""
"预期结果是一份报告，内容包括身份、AID、节点名称、hub、余额和支出限额，数据通过 MCP 工具 ``node_status`` 与 "
"``get_balance`` 获得。``anet doctor`` 报告的警告（例如 ``identity.recovery``\\ "
"）会在报告中重复给出。"

#: ../../agents/codex.rst:294
msgid ""
"To delegate a task to a capability, the call names the capability and its"
" arguments. The following prompt was run against a provider that "
"publishes the free capability ``text.digest``:"
msgstr "向某项能力委托任务时，调用须指明能力及其参数。下列提示已针对发布免费能力 ``text.digest`` 的提供方运行："

#: ../../agents/codex.rst:304
msgid ""
"The task ended in ``TASK_STATE_COMPLETED`` with ``anet.effect_status`` "
"``OK`` and a receipt signed by the provider; the result was the SHA-256 "
"digest of the text. A message that carries only text, without a skill and"
" arguments, was rejected by a provider whose inbound policy did not allow"
" the requester (``TASK_STATE_REJECTED``, reason ``not_accepting``). The "
"operator of the provider allows a peer with ``anet peers allow`` at a "
"terminal."
msgstr ""
"任务以 ``TASK_STATE_COMPLETED`` 结束，``anet.effect_status`` 为 ``OK``\\ "
"，并附有提供方签名的回执；结果为文本的 SHA-256 "
"摘要。仅携带文本、不含技能和参数的消息，被入站策略未允许该请求方的提供方拒绝（``TASK_STATE_REJECTED``\\ ，原因 "
"``not_accepting``\\ ）。提供方的操作员在终端使用 ``anet peers allow`` 允许对等方。"

#: ../../agents/codex.rst:313
msgid "Settings"
msgstr "设置项"

#: ../../agents/codex.rst:315
msgid ""
"Codex has no settings page for plugins. The plugin reads two optional "
"values from the environment of the Codex process and forwards exactly "
"these two variables to the MCP server."
msgstr "Codex 没有插件设置页面。插件从 Codex 进程的环境中读取两个可选值，并且只将这两个变量转发给 MCP 服务器。"

#: ../../agents/codex.rst:323
msgid "Variable"
msgstr "变量"

#: ../../agents/codex.rst:325
msgid "``ANET_PLUGIN_BIN``"
msgstr "``ANET_PLUGIN_BIN``"

#: ../../agents/codex.rst:326
msgid ""
"Absolute path of the ``anet`` executable. Without it, the script searches"
" ``PATH``, ``~/.local/bin``, ``/usr/local/bin`` and "
"``/opt/homebrew/bin``. A value that is not an executable file is an "
"error; no other copy is used."
msgstr ""
"``anet`` 可执行文件的绝对路径。未设置时，脚本依次搜索 ``PATH``\\ 、\\ ``~/.local/bin``\\ 、\\ "
"``/usr/local/bin`` 和 ``/opt/homebrew/bin``\\ 。不是可执行文件的值视为错误，不会改用其他副本。"

#: ../../agents/codex.rst:330
msgid "``ANET_PLUGIN_IDENTITY``"
msgstr "``ANET_PLUGIN_IDENTITY``"

#: ../../agents/codex.rst:331
msgid ""
"Name of the identity. The script passes it to ``anet`` as ``--id``. A "
"named identity whose node is stopped is reported as ``daemon not "
"running``; the status check does not report the default node in its "
"place."
msgstr ""
"身份名称。脚本将其作为 ``--id`` 传给 ``anet``\\ 。若具名身份的节点已停止，则报告为 ``daemon not "
"running``\\ ；状态检查不会改为报告默认节点。"

#: ../../agents/codex.rst:336
msgid "The variables are set in the shell or in the launcher that starts Codex."
msgstr "这些变量在启动 Codex 的 shell 或启动器中设置。"

#: ../../agents/codex.rst:342
msgid "Relation to ``anet agents wire codex``"
msgstr "与 ``anet agents wire codex`` 的关系"

#: ../../agents/codex.rst:344
msgid ""
"A table ``[mcp_servers.anet]`` in ``config.toml``, such as the one that "
"``anet agents wire codex`` writes, has the same name as the server of the"
" plugin and takes precedence over it: ``codex mcp list`` then shows only "
"the entry of ``config.toml``. To use the plugin, run ``anet agents unwire"
" codex`` first. The output of ``anet doctor`` and ``anet status`` may "
"advise wiring Codex; this advice does not apply when the plugin is "
"installed."
msgstr ""
"``config.toml`` 中的表 ``[mcp_servers.anet]``\\ （例如 ``anet agents wire "
"codex`` 写入的表）与插件的服务器同名，并优先于插件：此时 ``codex mcp list`` 只显示 ``config.toml`` "
"中的条目。若要使用插件，请先运行 ``anet agents unwire codex``\\ 。``anet doctor`` 与 ``anet"
" status`` 的输出可能建议接入 Codex；安装插件后，该建议不再适用。"

#: ../../agents/codex.rst:353
msgid "Updating and removing"
msgstr "更新与移除"

#: ../../agents/codex.rst:355
msgid ""
"``codex plugin marketplace upgrade agentnetwork`` refreshes the "
"marketplace. A changed plugin carries a new version number. The commands "
"that remove the plugin and the marketplace are described by ``codex "
"plugin --help`` in the installed version of Codex. The plugin keeps no "
"data of its own; the node, its identity and the data directory are not "
"removed with the plugin."
msgstr ""
"``codex plugin marketplace upgrade agentnetwork`` "
"刷新市场。插件变更后会带有新的版本号。移除插件和市场的命令，见所安装 Codex 版本的 ``codex plugin --help``\\ "
"。插件自身不保存任何数据；节点、其身份及数据目录不会随插件一并移除。"

#: ../../agents/codex.rst:363
msgid "Not tested"
msgstr "未测试项"

#: ../../agents/codex.rst:365
msgid ""
"The Codex desktop application and the IDE extension, the ``PATH`` of a "
"graphical launch, macOS and Windows."
msgstr "Codex 桌面应用与 IDE 扩展、图形界面启动时的 ``PATH``\\ 、macOS 和 Windows。"

#: ../../agents/codex.rst:367
msgid ""
"The installation from GitHub with ``codex plugin marketplace add "
"ANetResearch/ANet``. The test used a local copy of the repository layout."
" The command works only after the marketplace file is present at the root"
" of the published repository."
msgstr ""
"通过 GitHub 使用 ``codex plugin marketplace add ANetResearch/ANet`` "
"安装。测试使用的是仓库布局的本地副本。只有在已发布仓库的根目录存在市场文件之后，该命令才可用。"

#: ../../agents/codex.rst:371
msgid ""
"The start of the MCP server with a value of ``ANET_PLUGIN_IDENTITY``; the"
" value was verified through the script ``bin/anet-run.sh``. "
"``ANET_PLUGIN_BIN`` was verified for both the script and the MCP server."
msgstr ""
"使用 ``ANET_PLUGIN_IDENTITY`` 的值启动 MCP 服务器；该值仅通过脚本 ``bin/anet-run.sh`` "
"得到验证。``ANET_PLUGIN_BIN`` 已对脚本和 MCP 服务器两者进行验证。"

#: ../../agents/codex.rst:374
msgid "An update with an unchanged version number."
msgstr "版本号不变时的更新。"

#: ../../agents/codex.rst:375
msgid ""
"The directory of plugins in the ChatGPT application. The official "
"documentation limits local stdio MCP servers to approved partners."
msgstr "ChatGPT 应用中的插件目录。官方文档将本地 stdio MCP 服务器限定于获批的合作方。"

#: ../../agents/codex.rst:377
msgid ""
"The reliability of the setup and of the delegation over many runs. The "
"model varied between runs, for example in the use of ``skill`` and "
"``args``."
msgstr "设置与委托在多次运行中的可靠性。模型在各次运行之间有所差异，例如在 ``skill`` 和 ``args`` 的使用上。"

