msgstr "Codex 报告服务器 ``anet`` 启动失败。"

#: ../../agents/codex.rst:514
msgid ""
"No daemon answers. ``anet mcp`` exits with ``anet is not running ... run "
"anet up``."
msgstr "没有守护进程应答。``anet mcp`` 以 ``anet is not running ... run anet up`` 退出。"

#: ../../agents/codex.rst:516
