msgstr "Codex 主目录中存在 ``AGENTS.override.md``,Codex 读取它而不是 ``AGENTS.md``。"

#: ../../agents/codex.rst:525
msgid ""
"Merge the block between ``anet:begin`` and ``anet:end`` into the override"
