msgstr ""
"其他原因按原因码归类于 :doc:`/howto/troubleshooting`;原因码的完整列表见 :doc:`/reference"
"/reason-codes`。"

#: ../../agents/codex.rst:556
msgid "Removal"
msgstr "断开"

#: ../../agents/codex.rst:562
msgid ""
"The command removes the managed block from ``config.toml`` and the guide "
"from ``AGENTS.md``, keeps other tables and text, and copies each changed "
"file to a backup first. An entry named ``anet`` that ``wire`` did not "
"write is left unchanged. Manual removal deletes the table "
"``[mcp_servers.anet]`` and the guide between the lines ``anet:begin`` and"
" ``anet:end``. For an entry that was created with ``codex mcp add``, "
"``codex mcp remove anet`` is available in ``codex-cli 0.163.0``."
msgstr ""
"该命令移除 ``config.toml`` 中的托管块和 ``AGENTS.md`` "
"中的指引,保留其他表和文字,并先将每个被修改的文件复制为备份。名为 ``anet`` 但并非由 ``wire`` "
"写入的条目保持不变。手动移除时,删除 ``[mcp_servers.anet]`` 表以及 ``anet:begin`` 与 "
"``anet:end`` 两行之间的指引。对于用 ``codex mcp add`` 创建的条目,\\ ``codex-cli 0.163.0``"
" 提供 ``codex mcp remove anet``。"

